   "id": 632226,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"9\">\n    <li>According to the scatter plot below, what claim can be made about women’s shoe length and height?</li>\n  </ol>\n<img alt=\"A SCATTER PLOT THAT SHOWS SHOE LENGTH IN INCHES ON THE X-AXIS AND HEIGHT IN INCHES ON THE Y-AXIS. \" height=\"418\" src=\"exercises/media/e15968d7940b43d4.jpg\" width=\"450\">",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1224151,
     "content_html": "As a woman’s shoe length increases, their height also tends to increase."
    },
    {
     "id": 1224150,
     "content_html": "As a woman’s shoe length increases, their height decreases."
    }
